<tr><td style="padding-top:28px;padding-right:40px;padding-bottom:4px;padding-left:40px;"><table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0;"><tr><td bgcolor="#002B74" style="border-radius:4px;padding-top:6px;padding-right:12px;padding-bottom:6px;padding-left:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#002B74;">RELANCE DE PAIEMENT</td></tr></table><h1 style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:bold;color:#002B74;">Facture{{#if invoices.[1]}}s{{/if}} en attente de règlement</h1><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#374151;">Madame, Monsieur,</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#374151;">Nous intervenons en qualité de mandataire de la société <strong>{{creditor.name}}</strong>{{#if creditor.establishment}} pour l'établissement <strong>{{creditor.establishment}}</strong>{{/if}}.</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#374151;">Sauf erreur ou omission de notre part, <strong>{{debtor.company_name}}</strong> reste redevable de la somme de <strong>{{case.total_due}}</strong>, dont le détail figure ci-dessous.</p></td></tr>
